用cmd改网络的ip和物理地址;会清空其他ip
netsh interface ip set address "以太网 4" static 192.168.62.14 255.255.255.0 192.168.62.1
获取当前IP地址和子网掩码
ipconfig /all
获取物理地址
getmac /fo list
删除特定IP地址
netsh interface ip delete address "以太网" 192.168.62.2
添加地址
netsh interface ip add address "以太网 4" 192.168.62.2 255.255.255.0
